Error [E0204]: `t` is already lent to this call, so `pair` can't take it here too
  --> take_while_lent.jet:5:20
    |
  5 |     print(pair(t, ^t))
    |                    ^
 Why: An earlier argument lets `pair` read `t` for the whole call, so this argument can't hand the same value over
 Fix: Pass a copy to one of the two parameters with the copy marker `~` (`~t`)
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204

Error [E0204]: `u` is already lent to this call, so `pair` can't take it here too
  --> take_while_lent.jet:7:19
    |
  7 |     print(pair(u, u))
    |                   ^
 Why: An earlier argument lets `pair` read `u` for the whole call, so this argument can't hand the same value over
 Fix: Pass a copy to one of the two parameters with the copy marker `~` (`~u`)
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
